Agent skills under .claude/skills/

These files guide coding agents and reviewers. They are not part of the
pagevow binary and are not included in release archives.

The directories golang-benchmark, golang-concurrency, golang-context,
golang-error-handling, golang-performance, golang-safety and golang-security
come from samber/cc-skills-golang
(https://github.com/samber/cc-skills-golang), used under the MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2026 Samuel Berthe. The permission notice is the MIT text above.

The directory my-golang-performancer/references holds pages of the Go
Optimization Guide (https://goperf.dev/,
https://github.com/astavonin/go-optimization-guide) by Alexander Stavonin,
used under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Each file names its source
page in its first line. The pages were converted to Markdown; the text was
not otherwise changed.
